### Manual Verification
- After we push these changes, you will need to `git pull` on your server and restart the services:
  ```bash
  docker-compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml down
  docker-compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml up -d --build
  ```
- Re-run the Nginx setup script if needed: `bash scripts/setup_nginx.sh`.
